  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pip is a puppy. He is a boy puppy. Pip is happy. Now it is night. Pip is sleepy. He wants his bed. Pip loves his bed. His bed is warm. This is Pip's room. His room is clean. First, a bath. Pip is in the bath.",
      "Water is warm. Pip likes the warm water. Pip is clean. His body is clean. He brushes his teeth. His teeth are clean. Pip puts on pajamas. His pajamas are blue. They are soft pajamas. Pip is ready. Mama reads a book. Pip likes his book.",
      "The book is small. This book is fun. Pip is in his bed. He is under his blanket. His blanket is warm. His bed is soft. Pip closes his eyes. Pip is sleepy. He sleeps now. Good night, Pip. Pip is a happy puppy. He loves sleep."
    ],
    "summary": "It is night, and Pip is sleepy. First he has a warm bath. He brushes his teeth and puts on soft blue pajamas. Mama reads a book. Then Pip sleeps in his warm bed.",
